{"data":[{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:32:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111525811081949575"],"id":"2111525811081949575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":938,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111276969690038485","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🙃🙃 https://t.co/i8VVbqgjK4","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111525811081949575"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:59:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111502361587773507"],"id":"2111502361587773507","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":62,"impression_count":34758,"like_count":405,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":68},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111501770870698398","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Still waiting for further tracking data to confirm this, but this seems an unprecedented step by Russia if correct. I don't think it quite violates the Outer Space Treaty though (but IANAL) https://t.co/2Fkd4g8RJ0","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2111502361587773507"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111481535039778816"]},"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-17T15:39:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111482288135446909"],"id":"2111482288135446909","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":92,"impression_count":527650,"like_count":4311,"quote_count":71,"reply_count":234,"retweet_count":481},"text":"Teams encapsulated 32 payloads ahead of Falcon 9’s launch of the Bandwagon-5 rideshare mission from Florida → https://t.co/2mTwEZE4mX https://t.co/RXL3aqOINc","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2111482288135446909"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-16T22:54:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111229241748775223"],"id":"2111229241748775223","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":11995,"like_count":92,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":9},"text":"I talked to Space Daily about one of my favourite lines:\nhttps://t.co/oPZr2jbl89","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2111229241748775223"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["16_2111199761927651328"]},"author_id":"46648807","created_at":"2026-10-16T20:57:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111199771587158364"],"id":"2111199771587158364","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":34,"impression_count":11261,"like_count":237,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":32},"text":"We have had our last leap second! \n\nThe General Conference on Weights and Measures (CGPM) voted to officially eliminate leap seconds, establishing continuous Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) effective May 20, 2027. \n\n🔗 https://t.co/ED8xw4YOs3 https://t.co/4fnup6PFKH","url":"https://x.com/NIST/status/2111199771587158364"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111180787802370048"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-16T19:42:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111180963661435219"],"id":"2111180963661435219","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":316260,"like_count":1332,"quote_count":19,"reply_count":118,"retweet_count":181},"text":"The aircraft lineup just keeps getting bigger. ✈️\n\nMAX POWER, a new aerospace expo, is set for Nov. 7-8 @NASAKennedy — featuring flyovers and static displays, including NASA’s F-15, F-18, T-38, and ER-2 aircraft.\n\nDetails on how to join us: https://t.co/SPHni2YCxO https://t.co/pXYGxy6ZbE","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2111180963661435219"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T18:40:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111165516312428987"],"id":"2111165516312428987","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":8328,"like_count":17,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111164624024535307","type":"quoted"}],"text":"in 1477!!!!! https://t.co/rPls2RiuXz","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111165516312428987"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T18:03:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111155973377139159"],"id":"2111155973377139159","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":4229,"like_count":51,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111151882089722206","type":"quoted"}],"text":"They always used heavy infantry, but the late Roman period saw a decisive shift to cavalry which never shifted again until gunpowder.\n\nAt Tours, Martel had total strategic surprise, a massive difference in preparation for the field, and then an entire week to dig in. Even then, https://t.co/Sc21agnmEE","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111155973377139159"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T17:38:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111149772203516317"],"id":"2111149772203516317","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":7559,"like_count":81,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110782211272417459","type":"quoted"}],"text":"we ran this experiment\n\nfirst at Edessa in 260\n\nthen at Adrianople in 378\n\nthe cavalry win, period, done. well equipped, trained, coordinated mounted troops can only be bested by infantry under atypical conditions, usually a prepared defense https://t.co/khNc4EhOtW","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111149772203516317"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T16:53:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111138479736492497"],"id":"2111138479736492497","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3908,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111137769212846554","type":"quoted"}],"text":"they really aren't though.\n\nan electric engine is smaller so gives me more cargo space, and is cheaper to power/maintain, and people hauling kids often value cargo space and maintenance/fuel costs! https://t.co/GZjfnrzNmA","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111138479736492497"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:40:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111120157045146080"],"id":"2111120157045146080","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":109,"impression_count":23358,"like_count":404,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":33},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111091050077135308","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Lowkey much of American politics 1995-2026 can be seen as a great human capital reallocation as many of the brightest youth of evangelical parents brought their selected-for-moral-zeal personalities and upper-third human capital away from evangelicalism into progressivism. https://t.co/UQMB288Doi","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111120157045146080"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:36:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111119095383097416"],"id":"2111119095383097416","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5547,"like_count":107,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111115818792816649","type":"quoted"}],"text":"it's honestly bizarre we don't have a decent electric minivan yet!! https://t.co/oGXTuXjZa2","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111119095383097416"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:37:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111104137186123888"],"id":"2111104137186123888","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2669,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111099342027170024","type":"quoted"}],"text":"i dunno if this claim is true\n\nbut i want it to be true https://t.co/QiLZRlcHS0","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111104137186123888"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:56:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111094026598228027"],"id":"2111094026598228027","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1367,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111091957300638136","type":"quoted"}],"text":"The truly difficult engineering task! https://t.co/3SapTGVDAZ","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111094026598228027"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111093270277160960"]},"author_id":"11348282","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:53:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111093273800356092"],"id":"2111093273800356092","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":106,"impression_count":947172,"like_count":1776,"quote_count":16,"reply_count":135,"retweet_count":234},"text":"“It was the greatest adventure that four humans can ever go on.”\n\nListen to Artemis II's Christina Koch and Reid Wiseman reflect on their historic, 10-day journey around the Moon in a recent episode of Houston We Have a Podcast: https://t.co/VGDDcDzcdD https://t.co/lXdFczmfS0","url":"https://x.com/NASA/status/2111093273800356092"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111090703451213824"]},"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:44:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111090790781100055"],"id":"2111090790781100055","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":8389,"like_count":125,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":13},"text":"While Blue Origin continues its recovery work at Launch Complex 36A following the explosion in May, it's making multiple infrastructure investments to greatly increase launch cadence following their return to flight with New Glenn.\n\n📰: https://t.co/XjIgEwyUNq https://t.co/3JATKNgBYP","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2111090790781100055"},{"author_id":"6374602","created_at":"2026-10-16T13:25:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111086187016331394"],"id":"2111086187016331394","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":6567,"like_count":49,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":7},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111064691980087375","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Among the donors listed in the documents: Charlie Ergen of Dish Network/EchoStar ($25M), Lockheed Martin ($10M) and commercial space station developer Vast ($1M). https://t.co/0B84wqdGEC","url":"https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2111086187016331394"}