}],"text":"Surely some of this is just volume?\n\nSmaller markets move faster, and the ratio of new sales to stocks may also vary greatly. Shipping new cars to Kathmandu isn’t easy!! https://t.co/nZme61cQJv","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110928291842642287"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-16T01:59:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110913559832002961"],"id":"2110913559832002961","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":47287,"like_count":146,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":66,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110901067139735700","type":"quoted"}],"text":"How does it stay on the upside down road?? \n\nI understand the physics of the jet propulsion.\n\nIt’s the upside down driving that confuses me. https://t.co/t52LRi3KQ0","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110913559832002961"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110889569285496832"]},"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:29:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110890738234077369"],"id":"2110890738234077369","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":266,"impression_count":110016,"like_count":1320,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":90},"text":"A SpaceX Falcon 9 rocket launching on a secretive mission for the U.S. military gets a musical send-off from Vandenberg Space Force Base with the five o'clock bugle call 'Retreat' followed by the National Anthem. https://t.co/4YMB8Ha6ih","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2110890738234077369"},{"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-16T00:28:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110890591945130055"],"id":"2110890591945130055","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":622,"impression_count":1302577,"like_count":20233,"quote_count":176,"reply_count":399,"retweet_count":1602},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110788059008819215","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Go for launch 🚀 https://t.co/EZaRCwERZl","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2110890591945130055"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_21108864271729